Z||000000||Rodney||04-17-2000||10:50 AM||||Just wanted to mention that I offer the Fiero Competition Short Shifters. Most people know this but: I do sell just the shifter without the leather boot for $45 and $4 shipping. This is an all new shifter designed to stand correctly straight up in neutral. All new parts professionally machined and welded. Painted a semigloss black. Not a reworked old shifter arm. No core charge or exchange. The top is threaded 1 1/2" so if you desire it shorter you can cut some of the threaded area to shorten it up to 3/4" more. The bottem part of the arm is also slightly longer to further shorten the shifting action. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/</A> <P>I do not have the arm priced seperate on my web page yet. My guy has been busy. Possibly looking for someone to trade some parts for some web page work??<P>Rodney Dickman||||reg||1
