Z||000003||Eric||04-18-2000||10:21 AM||||I have that shifter.  I like the way it is strait and not bent.  Could be a problem for someone with really short arms though because fifth gear is kind of a reach.  The best part about the shifter is the leather boot.  Those of you who have seen my car can attest to the quality of the shifter boot.  Unlike the stock boot, the new one has a metal base and real nuts to hold it in place.||||reg||1
